{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If she tries anything shady or attempts to hurt you, push that button right in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It will execute her instantly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030980/extras/bcf73c21f35ce4e91532106690b0c3a7.poster.avif?t=1769612449\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030980/extras/bcf73c21f35ce4e91532106690b0c3a7.webm?t=1769612449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030980/extras/bcf73c21f35ce4e91532106690b0c3a7.mp4?t=1769612449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each play-through takes about 5 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point-and-click game controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the red execute button in front of you anytime\u2014even in the middle of a conversation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story changes depending on whether or not you press the button, when you press it, and the choices you make. Thirteen different endings all based on your choices, curiosity, and remorse.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Changes in the Update Version:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a remake of the free game &quot;5omeday&quot; released on Unityroom in October 2023. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Mira is now fully voiced.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New endings added along with background music, still shots, and illustrations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Newly added gallery feature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_p